dashi-channel — Telegram channel plugin for Claude Code.

Original work: https://github.com/qwwiwi/dashi-plugin-claude-code
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this folder).

This folder contains a copy of the plugin with modifications made for the
"Агент 007 на минималках" course starter:
- chat gate: in a private chat (chat.id == user.id) an allowed sender is
  accepted without a separate allowed-chats list;
- added a missing state store module and fixed .gitignore so it is not excluded;
- bun.lock is committed so every student gets the same dependency versions;
- .mcp.json removed from the plugin folder; the starter registers the server in its root .mcp.json.
